{"id":"n15210-1-8","stage":4,"title":"뛰어오다 · 跑来","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15210-1-8-1","ko":"저기서 이쪽으로 뛰어오는 사람이 네 동생 아니니?","zh":"那边跑过来的不是你弟弟或妹妹吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기서","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기서","audio":"/audio/c90dcfd042ebe999cf66.mp3"}},{"text":"이쪽으로","meaning":"这边","explanation":"이쪽：这边；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"이쪽","audio":"/audio/ceea9a2e61410973dfd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71694","senseId":"1","lemma":"이쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이쪽으로","audio":"/audio/bc86003914714bd63db7.mp3"}},{"text":"뛰어오는","meaning":"跑来","explanation":"뛰어오다：跑来；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"뛰어오다","audio":"/audio/c8f4fcf46b2390230bec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15210","senseId":"1","lemma":"뛰어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뛰어오는","audio":"/audio/0a1b7998e254dd259e1b.mp3"}},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람이","audio":"/audio/3f33d9d6ca9be288c4e3.mp3"}},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"동생","meaning":"弟弟；妹妹","explanation":"동생：弟弟；妹妹","readings":[{"term":"동생","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70748","senseId":"1","lemma":"동생","ori